<title>USA: Bolt Technology stake cut by investor.</title>
<headline>Bolt Technology stake cut by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Manning, director of the private client group at New York investment firm Cowen &amp; Co, said on Thursday he reduced his stake in Bolt Technology Corp to 4.9 percent or 248,494 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Manning said he sold 140,500 shares of Bolt Technology between October 17 and 29 at prices ranging from $5.12 to $6.06 a share.</p>
</text>
